      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Having completed my &quot;Multiverse Saving Contest&quot; I found it interesting to play a specific series of games to evaluate the effectiveness of the various teams of heroes. &nbsp;I felt that experiment helped me determine which team is the most effective (at least the way I play them). So I figured why not run a similar experiment for the villains?</p><p>Here are the rules:</p><p>1. Video game decks only.</p><p>2. Other than the villain matches will be randomly generated.</p><p>3. Each villain will play 6 games: 1 regular and 1 advanced of: 3 Hero, 4 Hero, 5 Hero combinations.</p><p>4. The outcome of each game, heroes, and environments will be tracked.</p><p>5. Once I go through the 6 games against each villain once, I will decide if I want to repeat this process to increase the sample size.</p>\r\n<body style=\"position: absolute; top: 5px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; left: -1000px;\">\r\n</body>\r\n<br />\r\n<body id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 5px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; left: -1000px;\">\r\n\t<table class=\"forum-table forum-table-topics forum-table forum-table-topics sticky-enabled cols-4 tableheader-processed sticky-table\" style=\"border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(37, 135, 196); margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 15px; width: 992.8px; clear: both; font-size: 12.24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, HelveticaNeue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(204, 213, 216);\"><tbody style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><tr class=\"even\" style=\"background-image: -webkit-gradient(linear, 0% 0%, 0% 100%, from(rgb(203, 226, 241)), to(rgb(237, 245, 250))); border-bottom-width: initial; border-style: solid none none; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 0.1em 0.6em; border-right-width: initial; border-left-width: initial;\"><td class=\"views-field views-field-title\" style=\"padding: 3px; border-width: initial; border-style: none;\"><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/multiverse-saving-contest-a-battle-of-the-teams-9360\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(40, 131, 222);\"><span class=\"forum-topic-title\">Multiverse Saving Contest - A Battle of the Teams</span>&nbsp;</a></td></tr></tbody></table></body>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p><br />",
